  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n\u0131n alt k\u0131s\u0131mlar\u0131nda bir bal ar\u0131s\u0131
    ve her iki yan\u0131nda da 1 ve 6 rakamlar\u0131 var {{isim}}. Bal ar\u0131s\u0131,
    ortaya konacak emek ve beklenecek \"yeterli zaman\" kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131nda,
    istenilene kesinlikle nail olunaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 i\u015Faret eder. Peki
    bu iki rakam\u0131n anlam\u0131 ne? <sprite=34>\n\nVeritaban\u0131mda yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131m
    analiz, bu rakamlar\u0131n 16 say\u0131s\u0131 \u015Feklinde okundu\u011Funda,
    erkek bal ar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n kromozom say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 verdi\u011Fini
    i\u015Faret ediyor. Ho\u015Fland\u0131\u011F\u0131n beyefendinin hayat\u0131nda
    bedenlenmeye ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131, ilk defa 16 g\xFCn sonra,
    yani tam {{gun_2}} g\xFCn\xFC hissedeceksin {{isim}}."
